iddle">0</text><text class="num" x="460.6" y="212" text-anchor="middle">0.5</text><text class="num" x="712.0" y="212" text-anchor="middle">1.0</text><line class="thr" x1="561.1" y1="44" x2="561.1" y2="196"/><text class="num ember" x="561.1" y="212" text-anchor="middle">0.70</text><text class="ember" x="561.1" y="38" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9.5">8 SD out, random never reaches it</text><rect class="sw-n" x="8" y="12" width="9" height="9"/><text x="22" y="20">random cross-artist pairs</text><rect class="sw-d" x="8" y="25" width="9" height="9"/><text x="22" y="33">nearest cross-artist neighbor</text></svg><figcaption>Residual cosine on one axis. Random cross-artist pairs center at zero and never reach 0.70, about 8 standard deviations out. Each track's nearest cross-artist neighbor is far more similar, with a tail past 0.70. A nearest-neighbor search across the catalogue finds 4,577 cross-artist pairs that clear it.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class="project__section"><p class="project__label">The program</p><div class="project__body"><p>Qualia is planned as five layers. Layer 0, the data, and this first result are complete and published.</p><dl class="nownext"><div><dt>Now</dt><dd>Layer 1, a Joint Embedding Predictive Architecture over listening sessions.</dd></div><div><dt>Next</dt><dd>Layers 2 to 5, a transition model, a policy, per-listener adaptation, and a reasoning interface, scoped but not yet built.</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class="project__section"><p class="project__label">Stack</p><div class="project__body"><ul class="project__chips"><li class="project__chip">Python</li><li class="project__chip">gensim</li><li class="project__chip">Last.fm API</li><li class="project__chip">DuckDB</li><li class="project__chip">Parquet</li><li class="project__chip">NumPy</li><li class="project__chip">UMAP</li></ul></div></section><a href="/work" class="project__back project__back--bottom">← Work</a></article>
